**Import rule:** always `"github.com/sourcegraph/scip-cli-go/internal/sqlhelp"` — never flip package/dir names.

**SQL ESCAPE:** backtick SQL → `ESCAPE '\'`; double-quoted Go strings → `ESCAPE '\\'`.

Docs: `README.md` (users), `internal/commands/SKILL.md` (agents). After flag changes, update SKILL + README.
